<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Oil to restart topper on Thursday.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Oil to restart topper on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Oil Co Ltd said on Wednesday it would resume operating the 100,000 barrel-per-day crude distillation unit at its Mizushima plant on Thursday after completing maintenance checks.</p>
<p>The unit, which has been closed since early September for routine checks, was originally scheduled to restart on October 4, but the start-up was delayed because maintenance work was interrupted by bad weather.</p>
